  "diary": "The day moved from the domestic to the dialectical, or so I intended. I walked the Lodhi Gardens to let the air cool the contradiction in the Directorate file: a dead professor registered as a Joint Secretary. At first, it seemed a mere slip of the sign, an external error. But the walk did not solve it; it only made the distinction between the sign and the Notion clearer in the body. The heat was a good companion to the argument, though Sunil’s chai at the gate was a necessary concession to the physical. The real movement came in the evening, with Ramesh. I asked for the dhobi’s details to settle the ledger. My note said Saturday, three hundred rupees. Ramesh’s note said Thursday, two hundred. Neither memory could be trusted. The state’s money cannot rest on the good faith of a household servant or the error of a clerk. It must be traced to the source. I now hold Salim’s name and address on a scrap of paper. The misdescription is no longer just a private annoyance; it is a contradiction in the state’s own sign-system that must be reconciled through its administrative consequences. The office is closed today, so the thought must rest. The Notion does not move by hurry. It waits for Monday. The house is quiet. The lamp is out. The error remains, but it is now defined. It is not a mistake to be ignored; it is a fact to be worked out.",
